- methodology: 1,761,487 bytes.
There is also a 'major changes' PDF (.../6a2940653b15d05a7ce3202f/2026-GHG-conversion-factors-major-changes-report.pdf) that the research did not list. The flat file front page shows Version 1.2 and next publication 2027-06-01. These rows match exactly: 21_316_3170_11_1 = 0.11704, 21_316_3171_11_1 = 0.06926, 21_316_3160_11_1 (domestic average, with RF) = 0.22928; the with/without-RF ratio is 1.69. EPA is confirmed too: the Hub's latest is '2025 ... January 2025' on a page last updated January 12, 2026, and eGRID is still eGRID2023 on a page last updated September 21, 2026.

The OKR API for hdl 10986/44787 shows:
- dc.date.issued 2026-05-19;
- dc.rights 'CC BY 3.0 IGO' (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/);
- DOI 10.1596/978-1-4648-2348-0;
