The worldbank.org page key messages 'nearly 30% ... across 87 implemented policies' and 'over $107 billion for public budgets in 2025' are confirmed; the 2025 messages were around 28% and $100bn. The dashboard still returns a Cloudflare 403 and datacatalogapi returns 429, so the dashboard data licence remains unverified. Do not assume CC BY 4.0 for the dashboard XLSX until it has been checked by hand.
